## JP-001: japan-adv-jomon-name (13 October 2026)
Unqualified generic example can be read as covering every Jomon pot, whereas the card correctly narrows the decorated population to numerous examples. Under strict no-unresolved-doubt policy, retain the narrower quantifier in the example. This is an ambiguity risk, not a demonstrated false universal asserted by Japanese grammar. (13 October 2026)
Evidence: [https://www.metmuseum.org/essays/jomon-culture-ca-10500-ca-300-b-c](https://www.metmuseum.org/essays/jomon-culture-ca-10500-ca-300-b-c). Proposed correction is retained in the JSON report and requires recheck. (13 October 2026)

